&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="abstract-class">Abstract Class
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#abstract-class">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>抽象类通常作为基类，比如 Person，Animal。因为不同子类的某种方法的 body可能不一样，所以把这些方法作为abstract method放在抽象类中。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>try-catch-finally</title><link>http://localhost:1313/post/trycatchfinally/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/post/trycatchfinally/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Nginx</title><link>http://localhost:1313/post/nginx/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/post/nginx/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="cli">CLI
&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#cli">&lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>nginx -V 查看 Nginx配置文件的位置：/opt/homebrew/etc/nginx/nginx.conf&lt;/p>
&lt;p>nginx命令启动master进程，nginx分为master进程和worker进程。
master进程负责读取配置文件、管理worker进程；worker进程实际处理HTTP请求。&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Synchronized 关键字</title><link>http://localhost:1313/post/synchronized/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/post/synchronized/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Java IO</title><link>http://localhost:1313/post/javaio/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/post/javaio/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="file">File
